    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A 3D action game in which a high school girl goes on a rampage at school!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blow away many classmates with combos!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Detect attacks with the sound of your headphones and parry!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Knock down the seniors with a lot of finishers!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are seven different weapons you can use! Use them all to become the ruler of the school!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >STORY MODE</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this mode, Nekomimi rules the school while defeating delinquents.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At first, you can only go to the first floor of the school building, but by defeating bosses and obtaining key items, you will be able to go to more and more areas!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can also buy recovery items in the purchasing department and rest in the infirmary!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Conquer every room in the school building!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >VS100 MODE</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survival mode in which you must defeat all 100 enemies in a small classroom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat all the enemies that appear! Make use of fallen weapons and items!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A 3D action game in which a high school girl goes on a rampage at school!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blow away many classmates with combos!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Detect attacks with the sound of your headphones and parry!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Knock down the seniors with a lot of finishers!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are seven different weapons you can use! Use them all to become the ruler of the school!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >STORY MODE</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this mode, Nekomimi rules the school while defeating delinquents.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At first, you can only go to the first floor of the school building, but by defeating bosses and obtaining key items, you will be able to go to more and more areas!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can also buy recovery items in the purchasing department and rest in the infirmary!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Conquer every room in the school building!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >VS100 MODE</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survival mode in which you must defeat all 100 enemies in a small classroom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat all the enemies that appear! Make use of fallen weapons and items!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
